  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/B2AACC">Remark <span data-tag="B2AACC">8.2.8.4</span>.</a> In the situation of Proposition <a href="/tag/B160E2" data-tag="B160E2">8.2.8.2</a>, if $\mathbf{A}$ is assumed to be right or left proper, then $\Fun (\calC , \mathbf{A})$ is likewise right or left proper (with respect to either the projective or the injective model structures). </p>
